{"id":"4f81acfa76416d15","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-recursion-parameters.md","title":"带参数的递归定理","display":"thm-recursion-parameters — 带参数的递归定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-recursion-parameters","aliases":["20-thm-recursion-parameters"],"display":"thm-recursion-parameters — 带参数的递归定理","chapter":"2","section":"2.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 2.2.6","source_pdf_pages":[68],"source_printed_pages":[32],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-recursion]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-recursion-parameters"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-recursion-parameters</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-recursion-parameters — 带参数的递归定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.2.6"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>32</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"416559051d6f8f46\" href=\"?note=416559051d6f8f46\" title=\"20-thm-recursion\">20-thm-recursion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"416559051d6f8f46\" href=\"?note=416559051d6f8f46\" title=\"20-thm-recursion\">20-thm-recursion</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}parameters}\\vdash\n\\exists n\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\bigl[(\\forall y\\in\\omega\\ \\varphi_{n(y)}=\\varphi_{f(n(y),y)})\\land\\forall y,z\\ [n(y)=n(z)\\Rightarrow y=z]\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}parameters}\\vdash\n\\exists n\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\bigl[(\\forall y\\in\\omega\\ \\varphi_{n(y)}=\\varphi_{f(n(y),y)})\\land\\forall y,z\\ [n(y)=n(z)\\Rightarrow y=z]\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>选整体单射的 s-m-n 编译器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(x,y)\">\\(d(x,y)\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{d(x,y)}(z)\">\\(\\varphi_{d(x,y)}(z)\\)</span> 先运行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_x^{(2)}(x,y)\">\\(\\varphi_x^{(2)}(x,y)\\)</span>，若得到索引 j 则运行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_j(z)\">\\(\\varphi_j(z)\\)</span>。取 v 编译全函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x,y)\\mapsto f(d(x,y),y)\">\\((x,y)\\mapsto f(d(x,y),y)\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n(y)=d(v,y)\">\\(n(y)=d(v,y)\\)</span>。展开即得固定点等式，且 d 的整体单射性直接保证 n 单射。不能在产生固定点后任意 padding n：变换 f 的参数也会随新索引改变。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 2.2.6；印刷页 32；PDF 第 68 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"416559051d6f8f46","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-recursion]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"416559051d6f8f46","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-recursion]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-recursion]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}parameters}\\vdash\n\\exists n\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\bigl[(\\forall y\\in\\omega\\ \\varphi_{n(y)}=\\varphi_{f(n(y),y)})\\land\\forall y,z\\ [n(y)=n(z)\\Rightarrow y=z]\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"d(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{d(x,y)}(z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_x^{(2)}(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_j(z)","display":false},{"tex":"(x,y)\\mapsto f(d(x,y),y)","display":false},{"tex":"n(y)=d(v,y)","display":false}],"bytes":1435,"backlinks":[{"id":"4f6ed68c536ba88e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-effective-inseparable]]；see [[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。"},{"id":"1d1387be254aae2b","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-fpf]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus]]；see [[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]。"},{"id":"7593f0ca3b4f470d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。"},{"id":"5fb6eea724c1b5f2","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-effective-immune]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus]]；see [[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]。"},{"id":"91e419d6023b31d0","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-effective-simple]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-movable-markers]]；see [[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]。"},{"id":"582399eb5e892787","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]。"},{"id":"141324e7d302145d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-lem-productive-total-injective]]；see [[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]；see [[20-thm-productive-properties]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"]